! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 26-FEB-2016, M. Woodley
!  * add wood door at LI30/BSY boundary (WOODDOOR)
!  * remove SEQnn MARKers
! 26-FEB-2016, Y. Nosochkov
!  * move RFBWSBP4, WSBP4 to linac sector 12 and rename to RFBWSBP1, WSBP1
!    (see DLBM.xsif) (Tor)
