! 12-DEC-2014, M. Woodley
!  * assign BPM TYPE attributes per PRD LCLSII-2.4-PR-0136
! 09-DEC-2014, Y. Nosochkov
!  * move STBP32 stopper to inside of the SXR spreader chicane and rename it
