! 22-JUL-2014, Y. Nosochkov
!  * move 4 bypass betatron collimators further downstream
! 02-MAY-2014, M. Woodley
!  * add RWWAKEss MARKER at end of bypass line (for resistive wall wakefield)
! 01-MAY-2014, Y. Nosochkov
